  "version": "0.8.1-beta.2",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.8.1-beta.1`\n\n### Features\n\n- let the crab look around: its pupils are their own layer, so the full crab glances left and right inside its eyes while both blink together, and the small crab blinks too; a knocking crab's eyes stop with its claws, so a tab waiting on an answer no longer keeps the window drawing frames ([baa41891](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/baa418913a3c64e034ab668b206800d67fd7a274))\n- check for updates from the tray menu: it shows the window, opens the update settings and checks the configured channel even when automatic checks are off, and records the check time; a download, install or restart already under way is shown instead of starting another check, and a manual check that joins a silent background check now shows its result or error rather than going back to idle ([6db9aab7](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/6db9aab7ad4f560e7d99748a16445c0ac4e4d75e))\n- let openSettingsTab open the settings page at a given section, switching an open settings tab to that section too, while opening it without one keeps the section it was on ([c513a933](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c513a933cc4c91b6d75c07ebfca49525b43f3944))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- end the settings search when something outside the page asks for a section, as the tray's update check does, so the results no longer cover the section it opened, even when that section was already the one open ([28ad1bc7](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/28ad1bc756a600e27a1c08828eef454fd2dd34f6))\n- keep an update check asked for from the tray until the UI takes it, and let the UI listen before the config has loaded and run the check once it has, so a click made while the app is still starting is no longer lost ([aff4c64f](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/aff4c64fb8915d68f89097a3193015360b68e860))\n- check the channel asked for when an update check of another channel is already running, by waiting for it to end and then checking again, so a check made just after switching channels no longer reports the old channel's result ([9404b4aa](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9404b4aab0bfbfd92f66929143ed16bb5e9b9288))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.8.1-beta.1...v0.8.1-beta.2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.8.1-beta.1...v0.8.1-beta.2)",
